<!doctype html><html lang="sk"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>WDFOX DNS Flow</title><style>:root{color-scheme:dark;--c:#39d9ff;--g:#31e7a5;--m:#9da8b5}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,#102a3a,#05070a 42%);color:#f4f7fb;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.w{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:30px 18px 70px}.nav{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.nav a{color:#dff8ff;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #315063;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:999px}header{text-align:center;margin:35px 0}h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--c),var(--g));-webkit-background-clip:text;color:transparent}p{color:var(--m)}.flow{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}.b{width:min(760px,100%);padding:17px;border:1px solid #34434f;border-radius:15px;background:#0c1218;text-align:center}.b strong{display:block;font-size:1.08rem}.b small{color:var(--m)}.a{padding:7px;color:#718594;font-size:24px}.dns{border-color:#4b78a0}.cloud{border-color:#ef9b47}.host{border-color:#31a66f}.note{margin-top:30px;padding:18px;border:1px solid #2c3944;border-radius:14px;background:#091017}.note b{color:var(--c)}</style></head><body><main class="w"><nav class="nav"><a href="/system-design">🌳 Architektúra</a><a href="/system-design/communication">🔗 Communication</a><a href="/system-design/web-development">🌐 Web Development</a></nav><header><h1>🌐 DNS → WDFOX</h1><p>Ako sa názov domény zmení na cestu k webovej aplikácii.</p></header><section class="flow"><div class="b"><strong>👤 1. ZÁKAZNÍK / BROWSER</strong><small>zadá foxprof.club</small></div><div class="a">↓</div><div class="b dns"><strong>💾 2. DNS CACHE</strong><small>prehliadač / OS skontroluje uložený DNS výsledok</small></div><div class="a">↓ cache miss</div><div class="b dns"><strong>🔎 3. RECURSIVE DNS RESOLVER</strong><small>ISP alebo verejný resolver hľadá autoritatívnu odpoveď</small></div><div class="a">↓</div><div class="b dns"><strong>🌍 4. ROOT DNS → TLD .club</strong><small>resolver zistí, ktoré servery poznajú autoritatívny DNS pre doménu</small></div><div class="a">↓</div><div class="b cloud"><strong>☁️ 5. AUTORITATÍVNY DNS / CLOUDFLARE</strong><small>DNS záznamy foxprof.club určia cieľ služby</small></div><div class="a">↓ DNS odpoveď</div><div class="b"><strong>📍 6. RESOLVER → BROWSER</strong><small>prehliadač dostane cieľ a môže vytvoriť spojenie</small></div><div class="a">↓ HTTPS</div><div class="b host"><strong>▲ 7. VERCEL / WDFOX</strong><small>TLS/HTTPS → deployment → Astro aplikácia</small></div><div class="a">↓</div><div class="b host"><strong>🦊 8. WDFOX APLIKÁCIA</strong><small>UI → API / komunikátor → n8n → agenti → MCP → externé služby</small></div></section><div class="note"><b>Dôležité:</b> DNS nespúšťa n8n ani agentov. Je to internetová adresovacia vrstva, ktorá dostane klienta od názvu domény k službe, na ktorej WDFOX beží.</div></main></body></html>